    "text": ":rotating_light: OLake Fusion v0.2.1 Released:rotating_light:\nRelease: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/releases/tag/v0.2.1|github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/…/v0.2.1\u003e\n*What’s New*\n• fix(integration-tests): OP-419 disable OLake telemetry during discover and sync by \u003c@U0C510Q1PQC\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/77|#77\u003e\n• chore(deps): high vulnerabilities - backend by \u003c@U0BF1NS2UJ0\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/61|#61\u003e\n• fix: frontend build and remove integration test approval on master and staging by \u003c@U0817E9CGRM\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/84|#84\u003e\n• chore: merge dependency and integration test fix by \u003c@U0817E9CGRM\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/83|#83\u003e\n• chore: fix frontend vulnerabilities (high) by \u003c@U0BF1NS2UJ0\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/88|#88\u003e\n• chore: moderate vulnerability fixes, frontend by \u003c@U0BF1NS2UJ0\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/95|#95\u003e\n• chore: adding fixes for vulnerabilities (\u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/99|#99\u003e) by \u003c@U0817E9CGRM\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/101|#101\u003e\n• chore: removing derby due to vulnerability (\u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/102|#102\u003e) by \u003c@U0817E9CGRM\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/103|#103\u003e\n• feat: fusion snapshot expiry by \u003c@U0BF1NS2UJ0\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-fusion/pull/96|#96\u003e\n:rotating_light: OLake UI v0.9.2 Released:rotating_light:\nRelease: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-ui/releases/tag/v0.9.2|github.com/datazip-inc/olake-ui/…/v0.9.2\u003e\n*What’s New*\n• feat(maintenance): snapshot expiry (cleanup) config, run history